<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n78333" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρᾰλία</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ιη</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γῆ</span> or <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χώρα</span>), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>seacoast, seaboard</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς Θρηΐκης τὴν π</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				7.185
			</span></i> ; of Epidaurus, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1411a11
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> esp. of
				<i>the maritime district</i> or <i>seaboard of Attica</i>,
			between Hymettus, Brauron, and Sunium, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				5.81
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παραλία [γῆ</span>] <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				2.56
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ χώρα ἡ π</span>. <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				2.1195
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ π</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				3.39.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				9.1.21
			</span></i> ; also 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ παράλιος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					3.15
				</span></i>
			, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ Παράλιοι,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ Πάραλοι</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.805e
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Παράλιον, τό</span>, <i>sanctuary of the hero</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πάραλος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Rev.Et.Gr.</u>
				44.294
			</span></i> (Attica, <span class="entity">iv B. C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				D.
				49.25
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">Phot.,
					<u>AB</u>294</span></i>.
				[<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πᾱρᾰλίη</span>, metri gr., <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				4.1560
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.P.
				253
			</span></i>.]</div>
